Subject: set StartupWMClass to org.kde.audex and drop the undefined MIME type

Audex sets its desktop file name, and so its Wayland app_id, to
org.kde.audex; upstream's class names no window Audex opens. No shared MIME
database file defines application/x-audex, so that claim matches no file.

--- a/org.kde.audex.desktop
+++ b/org.kde.audex.desktop
@@ -78,10 +78,9 @@
 GenericName[zh_CN]=CDDA 翻录
 GenericName[zh_TW]=CDDA 翻錄
 Exec=audex
-StartupWMClass=audex
+StartupWMClass=org.kde.audex
 Icon=org.kde.audex
 Type=Application
-MimeType=application/x-audex;
 Categories=Qt;KDE;AudioVideo;
 Terminal=false
 X-DocPath=https://userbase.kde.org/Audex
